"Let $c_{r}$ be the asymptotic extremal constant associated with the smallest signless Laplacian eigenvalue of $K_{r+1}$-free graphs. **Asymptotic smallest Q-eigenvalue conjecture.** For every $r\\geq3$,\n\n$$\nc_{r}=1-\\frac{2}{r}.\n$$\n\nThe source states this as a weaker form of the Turán graph extremality conjecture. It gives the bounds $1-2/r<c_{r}\\leq1-3/(3r-1)$, so the conjecture remains open in the supplied text."